  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Sixth prerelease; code written against 0.4.x builds and runs as it was. New: GameInspector.Verbs and VerbName(verb), the names a release shows its verbs by, for the numbers objects' verb tables use (the NES has its own, and no Fix, Unlock or What is); numbers that are no verb a player picks (16, 253, 255) have none. Fixed: in the 1987 DOS release and its demo, a figure facing left was drawn seven pixels too far left (the meteor, and Syd and Razor facing Dave); it is placed as ScummVM places it. Packing now compares the library with the last release on nuget.org, so a public member removed or changed fails the build.",
